  "details": "After the amount of \"Favorites\"(AVATARS) exceeded 50 (sum of \"Favorite Avatars\", \"VRC+ Group1\", \"VRC+ Group2\" & \"VRC+ Group3\") , even if I increased favorite avatars, the displaying value of favorite avatars was remained at 50.\nAt the same time (after the the amount of \"Favorites\" exceeded 50), the value of favorites display decreased about \"Favorite Avatars\" and \"VRC+ Group1\" from true value every I added favorite avatar to each category. This bug resulted in the displaying values of \"Favorite Avatars\" and \"VRC+ Group1\" were become zero and \"VRC+ Group2\" and \"VRC+ Group3\" were become 25, when the amount of favorite avatars reached to 100. \nAfter my favorite avatars were 100, I could not the add favorite avatar to any category but I could select \"Favorite Avatars\" and \"VRC+ Group1\" in the interface of adding favorite avatar.",
